{"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RenderPhase"}],"role":"symbol","title":"RenderPhase","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RenderPhase"}],"modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"symbolKind":"enum","externalID":"s:10TUIkitView11RenderPhaseO"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The evaluation phase of the current render pass."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tuikit\/renderphase"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RenderPhase"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A single frame may traverse the view tree several times before anything"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reaches the terminal:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Layout measurement"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — containers call ","type":"text"},{"code":"sizeThatFits","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (or render to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"measure) arbitrarily often to negotiate sizes, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"RenderLoop","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"performs a full sizing pass on the first frame to discover the app","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"header height. None of these traversals produce the frame’s output.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Candidate-tree evaluation"}]},{"text":" — the pass whose buffer becomes (or may","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"become) the frame’s terminal output. A frame can evaluate more than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"one candidate: when the header height turns out different from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"estimate, a correction pass re-evaluates the tree and the earlier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"candidate is discarded.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RenderPhase"},{"text":" makes this distinction explicit on ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderContext\/phase","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so that effect sites can tell sizing work apart from output work.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Invariants","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Invariants"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/measure"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"no effect may reach live runtime state","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": no lifecycle"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or task mounting, no focus or handler registration, no state, cache,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"preference, header, status-bar, or terminal mutation. Bodies must be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"evaluable arbitrarily often without observable consequences."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/render","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", effects belong to a ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"candidate","type":"text"}]},{"text":" tree. They must not be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"applied to live runtime state during traversal either, because the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"candidate may still be discarded by a correction pass. Instead they are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"recorded and applied exactly once when the frame commits (see the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"classification rule below).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Committing is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" a phase of this enum: no view body is ever"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"evaluated while the frame commits. The commit is an explicit step in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RenderLoop.render()"},{"type":"text","text":" after the final candidate is known."}]}]}]},{"anchor":"Classifying-an-effect","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Classifying an effect"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When writing or reviewing an effect site, ask one question:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"“Does the effect outlive the frame?”","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"No","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (key handlers, preference values, status-bar items, header"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffer, focus registrations): write it into the current pass’s scratch"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"collector. The final pass’s collector replaces the live state wholesale;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"discarded passes are simply dropped."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onAppear"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDisappear"},{"type":"text","text":" actions, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".task"},{"type":"text","text":" mounts, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onChange"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onPreferenceChange"},{"type":"text","text":" actions, GC liveness): record it. The frame"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"commit diffs the final records against persistent runtime state and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applies the difference exactly once."}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This mirrors SwiftUI’s model, where per-update values are recomputed and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"replaced with each committed tree, while lifetime effects derive from the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identity diff between committed trees.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"See Also","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderContext\/phase"},{"type":"text","text":", and the frame choreography comment on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"RenderLoop"},{"type":"text","text":" for where each phase begins and ends."}]}],"style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/SQ","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/SH","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/s8SendableP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase"},"topicSections":[{"title":"Enumeration Cases","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/measure","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/RenderPhase\/render"],"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases"},{"title":"De